very good. My wife ordered a 50-50 burger - a mix of ground beef and hot Italian sausage. Tha..."},{"business_id":"036_95rJbB7PvCHfkCL6Nw","review_id":"WD0ey8PfiLxEvmWsviWywA","date":"2016-05-22T19:16:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9203661680221558,"text_excerpt":"First place we stopped for lunch on Friday. At this time Bourbon street isn't too bad, so we managed to get a table upstairs on the balcony in the shade. Our waitress was really fun and put us in a good mood. No tap beers upstairs but there was a reasonable selection of local beers. I chose gumbo to eat. You have a choice in portion sizes and the bowl was the right size dos lunchtime I feel. Would be happy to go back."},{"business_id":"036_95rJbB7PvCHfkCL6Nw","review_id":"W0zqWJc8Lsb3ResrSetcyw","date":"2019-09-04T12:11:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9201036691665649,"text_excerpt":"Never Fails. We enjoyed the balcony. We enjoyed the service. Shoutout to Shelley! We enjoyed the etouffee, seafood gumbo (even though some rice was under cooked), the catfish po'boy and the kick ass sauce with shrimp we received since they ran out of BBQ shrimp. We appreciated the price. We loved our experience at Johnny White's Pub & Grill for lunch"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"036_95rJbB7PvCHfkCL6Nw","photo_id":"6yVgT6wNHaFnM_O8LLPb7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6yVgT6wNHaFnM_O8LLPb7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8806248903274536},{"business_id":"036_95rJbB7PvCHfkCL6Nw","photo_id":"LI1VaUeSLEOKj2YEogmVDQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LI1VaUeSLEOKj2YEogmVDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8329547643661499},{"business_id":"036_95rJbB7PvCHfkCL6Nw","photo_id":"023HjHdvC8Y8bbQtzjrtQg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/023HjHdvC8Y8bbQtzjrtQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7872968912124634},{"business_id":"036_95rJbB7PvCHfkCL6Nw","photo_id":"h96N3tKbVysxSBNxHeYJqw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/h96N3tKbVysxSBNxHeYJqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7871555089950